flowchart TD
  A[Logging] --> B[Validation]
  B --> C[Resolve one owner executor]
  C --> H[Handler]
  H --> R{Result success?}
  R -- no --> D[Discard tracked changes and facts]
  R -- yes --> E[Execution strategy]
  E --> T[Begin local transaction]
  T --> P[Prepare participants]
  P --> S[SaveChanges once]
  S --> M[Commit]
  M --> Q[Dispatch after commit]
